n from business-definition drift. The possible stories are that renamed or re=
coded fields break history, that new fields are additive, or that null patter=
ns reveal a source rollout rather than missing customer data.

This has returned because the previous answer was useful but not strong enoug=
h to become a standing rule. Use November 2023 as the new evidence point rath=
